{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a non-linear pure logic puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a challenging journey where you may encounter unknown and complex puzzles, enjoying the pleasure of exploring the unknown and solving difficult puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by relaxing and pleasant background music, you will delve into an increasingly complex world, exploring the most complex and difficult puzzles in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is click on cells and use logical reasoning to complete a wide variety of puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 50 puzzle types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 600 unique handcrafted puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A rich note system to help players reason</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No language support required \u2014 accessible to players worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 20 tracks of relaxing and pleasant atmospheric music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A minimalist hand-drawn art style</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044990?t=1767885961","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044990?t=1767885961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044990/7961e28d96ec7a9883ba9a11a9bdb45509df97f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767885961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044990/7961e28d96ec7a9883ba9a11a9bdb45509df97f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767885961","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4062610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a non-linear pure logic puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a challenging journey where you may encounter unknown and complex puzzles, enjoying the pleasure of exploring the unknown and solving difficult puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by relaxing and pleasant background music, you will delve into an increasingly complex world, exploring the most complex and difficult puzzles in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is click on cells and use logical reasoning to complete a wide variety of puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 50 puzzle types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 600 unique handcrafted puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A rich note system to help players reason</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No language support required \u2014 accessible to players worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 20 tracks of relaxing and pleasant atmospheric music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A minimalist hand-drawn art style</p>","developers":["Doseo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044990/2279d2af49d62520fd1f04f8b2d3d310af5abc57/header.jpg?t=1767885961","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044990/1832222197/d625d2e230813a5c00462c4096ffcec996d2ef1f/1767756200/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767756687","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044990/1832222197/d625d2e230813a5c00462c4096ffcec996d2ef1f/1767756200/dash_h264.mpd?t